  "gates": {
    "spec": {
      "approved_by": "SamuelJennings",
      "at": "2026-08-25T10:10:00Z",
      "self_resolved": [
        "A contributor form presents family and given directly and keeps the particles, suffix and unparsed organizational form reachable",
        "The three citation-processor flags stay off the form and are preserved untouched, as categories and custom already are",
        "A stored date whose only content is unparsed is shown, so an imported date the catalogue could not read can be repaired",
        "Nothing is written until a save succeeds in full, so a rejected save leaves no orphaned contributor records",
        "An identifier kind typed in different casing than the one offered is treated as that kind and checked",
        "The same name entered twice in one role on one reference is stored, with no warning",
        "Reordering acts within a role; no ordering across roles is offered",
        "One identifier per kind and one date per slot are inherited unchanged; a refusal names the limit",
        "Refined 2026-08-25 after measurement: the check-digit distinction covers ISBN alone, because the package never verifies the ISSN check digit and adding that would reject values it accepts today (D11); the gap is filed as #118"
      ]
    },
